label Greeting
KuyaKap: Oh hello.[pause=0.5].[pause=0.5].[pause=0.5] Can you get me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction.ItemWants}[/color]? Just what I need today.
- Will do!
[end_timeline]

label Talk
KuyaKap: Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction.ItemWants}[/color] for now.
- Alright, one moment.
	KuyaKap: Sige sige.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, I can't get that right now.
	KuyaKap: Ah, ganon ba? [pause=0.4] No worries.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction.WantsDebt}:
	KuyaKap: Maraming salamat! [pause=0.5]
	KuyaKap: [wave]Oh...[/wave] [pause=0.4] I just realized I forgot my wallet at home.
	KuyaKap: Is it okay if I take this on [color=#0f6e2f]utang[/color] for now? [pause=0.4] Babayaran ko na lang bukas ha.
	- Sure, no problem.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		KuyaKap: Wow, thank you! [pause=0.3] You're the best!
		KuyaKap: See you tomorrow!
	- Sorry, no credit today.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		KuyaKap: Ah... [pause=0.4] I see. [pause=0.3] Sige, maiiwan ko muna 'to rito ha.
		KuyaKap: Babalik ako kapag may pera na ako. [pause=0.4] Salamat pa rin!
else:
	KuyaKap: Perfect. Thanks.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
KuyaKap: Hindi 'yan yung hinihingi ko ah. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction.ItemWants}[/color] nga.
- Ah sorry, sandali lang.
	KuyaKap: Sige, mag-aabang na lang ako.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, wala kaming stock nun.
	KuyaKap: Ganon? Sige na lang.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]